  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS Ukraine Winterization Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based the destruction of some 40 per cent of Ukraine&#x2019;s energy infrastructure by November 2022 as a result of the widespread infrastructural damage, the objective is to help alleviate the energy and heating crisis during the winter months in Ukraine. Denmark has committed to provide critical emergency energy and heating support to the region of Mykolaiv, at the request of the Government of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
